From 045256900af5d7ecb785d1f3b272f102bb0deb1a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Valentin Caron <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 17:34:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: stm32: implement PSCI OSI in ST stm32mp13 boards

Adopt PSCI power domains. STM32MP13 is already SCMI-based.
LP-timer4 has been activated to allow PSCI OSI mode to work correctly.

Signed-off-by: Valentin Caron <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: Ic3e5bb41f710441c65c78843aa6b1f7e27ececd1
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/593167
Domain-Review: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
---
 arch/arm/boot/dts/st/stm32mp131.dtsi    | 127 +++++++++++++++++++++++-
 arch/arm/boot/dts/st/stm32mp133.dtsi    |   4 +
